    <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px 32px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);">
      <span style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">HANDOVER INSPECTION</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Packers And Movers In Dewas/bike Transportation</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When a two‑wheeler or motorcycle arrives at its final destination, the delivery handover is a critical checkpoint that confirms the vehicle’s integrity, mileage, and contractual compliance.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The process begins with a daylight condition re‑inspection, which is performed by the receiving agent in the presence of the driver or authorized recipient.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The agent compares the current exterior and interior condition of the bike against the original pickup photographs taken by the driver at the point of departure.</span></li></ul>
<p>Any discrepancies—such as new scratches, dents, or fluid leaks—must be documented with fresh photographs and an explanatory note. This visual audit ensures that any damage incurred during transit is captured accurately and can be reported to the freight forwarder or insurer as needed.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Daylight Condition Re‑Inspection</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Conducted in natural light to avoid shadows that could hide defects. The agent checks frame alignment, wheel integrity, brake pads, and all exposed components.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Odometer Verification</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The mileage recorded on the motorcycle’s odometer is cross‑checked against the mileage listed on the LR bilty. The driver is asked to read the odometer aloud, and the value is recorded in the delivery log.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>A variance of more than 50 km triggers a review and may indicate a potential odometer tampering or mechanical issue</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Signed Condition Sign‑Off</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">After the visual and mileage checks are complete, the driver signs the delivery receipt. The receipt includes a section for the receiving agent’s signature, the date, and a brief statement confirming that the bike was delivered in the condition described.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>This signed document becomes part of the shipment’s final audit trail</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<p>By following this structured handover procedure, companies can protect themselves against post‑delivery disputes, maintain accurate mileage records for warranty and resale purposes, and provide a transparent audit trail that satisfies both the shipper and the insurer. Consistency in daylight inspections, meticulous odometer checks, and formal sign‑offs are the backbone of reliable two‑wheeler logistics.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



